{"seq":2,"slug":"vital-signs-and-health-assessment","title":"生命体征与健康评估","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/nursing-fundamentals/vital-signs-and-health-assessment","wordCount":1166,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"生命体征与健康评估\">生命体征与健康评估</h1><p>每天交接班，我做的第一件事就是拿着记录本挨个测量：体温、脉搏、呼吸、血压。一开始觉得机械重复，直到有次一个病人脉搏突然飙到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>130</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">130</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">130</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分、血压往下掉，我才反应过来——这四个数字其实是病人身体在向我&quot;报警&quot;。学会读懂这些信号，是护士最基本也最救命的本领。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>生命体征（Vital Signs）</strong> 包括体温（T）、脉搏（P）、呼吸（R）、血压（BP），近年常把疼痛和血氧饱和度也纳入观察。</li>\n<li>各项正常参考范围：体温 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>37</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">36{\\sim}37\\,^\\circ\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">37</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>（腋温），脉搏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60{\\sim}100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分，呼吸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16{\\sim}20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分，血压收缩压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>139</mn><mtext> mmHg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90{\\sim}139\\ \\text{mmHg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">139</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmHg</span></span></span></span></span></span>、舒张压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>89</mn><mtext> mmHg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60{\\sim}89\\ \\text{mmHg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">89</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmHg</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>健康评估</strong> 是有目的地收集病人健康资料的过程，方法包括问诊、视诊、触诊、叩诊、听诊。</li>\n<li>体格检查遵循固定顺序，原则是&quot;先无创后有创、先一般后局部、不打断病人配合&quot;。</li>\n<li>评估资料分主观资料（病人诉说）和客观资料（你测量观察到的），两者要相互印证。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"四大生命体征怎么看\">四大生命体征怎么看</h3><p>测量数值只是第一步，关键是看&quot;趋势&quot;和&quot;组合&quot;。单次体温 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>38</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">38\\,^\\circ\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">38</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 不一定要紧，但若持续上升加上脉搏增快，就要警惕感染。脉搏和体温通常同步变化：体温每升高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,^\\circ\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>，脉搏约增快 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分。</p>\n<p>血压测量要注意袖带位置与心脏齐平，过紧测得偏低、过松测得偏高。对怀疑休克的病人，可以用<strong>休克指数</strong>快速判断失血程度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>休克指数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>脉率</mtext><mtext>收缩压</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{休克指数} = \\frac{\\text{脉率}}{\\text{收缩压}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">休克指数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收缩压</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">脉率</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>正常约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>；当指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span>，提示失血量约占血容量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%{\\sim}30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>；指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span> 则提示重度失血，需立即处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"健康评估的五种方法\">健康评估的五种方法</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[问诊: 收集主观资料] --&gt; B[视诊: 看皮肤面色姿势]&#10;    B --&gt; C[触诊: 摸温度包块压痛]&#10;    C --&gt; D[叩诊: 判断脏器界限积液]&#10;    D --&gt; E[听诊: 心音肺音肠鸣音]\">flowchart LR\n    A[问诊: 收集主观资料] --&gt; B[视诊: 看皮肤面色姿势]\n    B --&gt; C[触诊: 摸温度包块压痛]\n    C --&gt; D[叩诊: 判断脏器界限积液]\n    D --&gt; E[听诊: 心音肺音肠鸣音]</pre><p>腹部检查是个例外：顺序要改成&quot;视、听、叩、触&quot;，因为先触诊会刺激肠道、影响肠鸣音的真实听诊结果。这种&quot;看似违反常规&quot;的细节，正是高职阶段要求理解原理而非死记的地方。</p>\n<h3 id=\"问诊的技巧\">问诊的技巧</h3><p>问诊不是填表，而是引导病人讲出有用信息。多用开放式提问（&quot;哪里不舒服？&quot;）而非封闭式（&quot;你头疼吗？&quot;），后者容易诱导病人附和。对疼痛要问全 OPQRST：诱因、性质、放射、程度、时间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"异常值的识别与上报\">异常值的识别与上报</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>危急值（需立即处理/上报）</th>\n<th>可能提示</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>体温</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>39</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 39\\,^\\circ\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">39</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>35</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 35\\,^\\circ\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>严重感染 / 体温过低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脉搏</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分</td>\n<td>心律失常 / 休克早期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>呼吸</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 28</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">28</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分</td>\n<td>呼吸抑制 / 呼吸衰竭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>血氧</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SpO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SpO}_2 &lt; 90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SpO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低氧血症</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>记住：发现危急值不是自己默默处理，而是<strong>测量—复核—立即报告医生—记录</strong>，这是病人安全的红线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一位病人腋温 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>39.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">39.5\\,^\\circ\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">39.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>，按&quot;体温升高脉搏同步增快&quot;的规律，估算他的脉搏大约是多少？</li>\n<li>一位外伤病人脉率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分、收缩压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mtext> mmHg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\ \\text{mmHg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmHg</span></span></span></span></span></span>，算出休克指数并判断失血程度。</li>\n<li>为什么腹部体格检查要把听诊放在触诊之前？</li>\n<li>你测得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SpO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SpO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SpO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>88</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">88\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">88%</span></span></span></span></span>，但病人说&quot;我没事&quot;，主观和客观资料矛盾时你应该怎么办？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>找一台电子血压计和指夹式血氧仪，给自己和家人测一测，记录一周数据，体会&quot;趋势&quot;比&quot;单次值&quot;更有意义。</li>\n<li>了解早期预警评分（如 NEWS2）如何把多项生命体征整合成一个分数，提前发现病情恶化，这是当前国内外病房广泛推行的工具。</li>\n<li>观察医院里&quot;生命体征记录单&quot;的画法，理解为什么体温脉搏要画成连线曲线——趋势一眼可见。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生命体征是病人身体的实时报警系统，护士要看的不只是数值，更是趋势和组合。健康评估靠问诊加视触叩听五种方法，腹部检查顺序要特殊处理。休克指数等简单公式能帮你快速判断危重程度。最关键的是养成&quot;发现异常立即复核上报&quot;的习惯。下一节我们把基础护理操作和病人安全讲透，让这些日常技能成为你的肌肉记忆。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生命体征与健康评估","id":"生命体征与健康评估"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"四大生命体征怎么看","id":"四大生命体征怎么看"},{"level":3,"text":"健康评估的五种方法","id":"健康评估的五种方法"},{"level":3,"text":"问诊的技巧","id":"问诊的技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"异常值的识别与上报","id":"异常值的识别与上报"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"护理程序与护理理论模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/nursing-fundamentals/nursing-process-and-care-models"},"next":{"title":"基础护理操作与病人安全","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/nursing-fundamentals/basic-nursing-skills-and-safety"}}